---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft file - commands (input -> output)
  base64      file -> file       Encode to base64, or --decode back to bytes
  duplicates  file... -> report  Find files with identical content; deletes nothing
  encoding    text -> text       Convert text encoding, normally to UTF-8; fixes line endings
  hash        file... -> report  Checksums: --algorithm md5|sha1|sha256|sha512|blake3|crc32
  join        file... -> file    Put parts back together, in the order given
  organize    file... -> dir     Copy files into folders: --group type|ext|month
  rename      file... -> report  Batch rename: --find, --replace, --name, --case; --preview
  split       file -> parts...   Cut a big file into parts: --part-size 100MB
More: deft file <command> --help
